### ============================================
### UserFeatureController HTTP 接口测试
### ============================================

### 1. 根据用户 ID 获取用户特征
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/user?userId=1001

### 2. 保存或更新用户特征（如果存在则更新，不存在则插入）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/save-or-update
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": 1,
  "nickname": "张三",
  "school": "浙江大学",
  "education": "硕士",
  "major": "计算机科学与技术",
  "gender": "男",
  "graduationDate": "2025-06-30",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "targetPosition": "Java开发工程师",
  "targetCity": "杭州",
  "description": "热爱编程，有丰富的项目经验",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 3. 插入用户特征（新增记录）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/insert
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": 2,
  "nickname": "李四",
  "school": "北京大学",
  "education": "本科",
  "major": "软件工程",
  "gender": "女",
  "graduationDate": "2026-06-30",
  "email": "lisi@example.com",
  "targetPosition": "前端开发工程师",
  "targetCity": "北京",
  "description": "专注于前端开发，熟悉 React 和 Vue"
}

### 4. 更新用户特征（根据 ID 更新）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/update
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "id": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "nickname": "张三丰",
  "school": "浙江大学",
  "education": "硕士",
  "major": "计算机科学与技术",
  "gender": "男",
  "graduationDate": "2025-06-30",
  "email": "zhangsanfeng@example.com",
  "targetPosition": "高级Java开发工程师",
  "targetCity": "杭州",
  "description": "热爱编程，有丰富的项目经验，擅长分布式系统"
}

### 5. 查询用户特征列表（无条件查询所有）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list

### 6. 根据用户 ID 查询用户特征列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list?userId=1

### 7. 根据意向岗位查询用户特征列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list?targetPosition=Java开发工程师

### 8. 根据意向城市查询用户特征列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list?targetCity=杭州

### 9. 根据学历查询用户特征列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list?education=硕士

### 10. 多条件组合查询用户特征列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/list?targetPosition=Java开发工程师&targetCity=杭州&education=硕士

### 11. 根据 ID 删除用户特征
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/user-feature/delete?id=2
